The adapted code was split into smaller modules and modified for kah. It is
mainly in these areas:

  crates/kah-core     ledger, intent_history, projection, session_bundle,
                     run_store and verification modules
  crates/kah-codex    Codex source intake (source), native hook input and
                     projection encoding (hooks) and plugin control command
                     parsing (plugin_control)
  crates/kah-observer observer session, inspect-state and hook event stores,
                     and observer model configuration (compaction/config.rs)

kah does not include the driftctl command-line application or its other
workflows. The driftctl copyright and permission notice follows.

